  "content": "<h1>聊天快照</h1><p>ChatShot 是一款輕量級客戶端模組，可讓您將聊天訊息以文字或透明圖片形式複製到剪貼簿！</p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/DeDiamondPro/ChatShot/assets/67508414/ba55f3e4-cca1-432c-8cda-38d5269da499\" alt=\"圖片\"></p><p>只需點擊聊天訊息後方的按鈕，或點擊右下角按鈕即可複製整個聊天畫面的截圖！</p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/DeDiamondPro/ChatShot/assets/67508414/1777f265-804f-47ea-a856-f681b3020c5d\" alt=\"圖片\"><img src=\"https://github.com/DeDiamondPro/ChatShot/assets/67508414/04193c63-2cc1-440b-b404-430faefd4806\" alt=\"圖片\"></p><h2>致謝</h2><ul>\n<li>ChatShot 深受 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fchatting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Polyfrost</a> 開發的 1.8.9 版本模組 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fchatting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Chatting</a> 啟發。</li>\n<li>複製圖標由 mo2men 創作</li>\n<li>模組圖標使用 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flucide.dev%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">lucide</a> 的圖標素材</li>\n</ul><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fdiamond%253fr%253dChatShot\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/f8d261be-4548-4456-93f7-b3780517c6fd.webp\" alt=\"https://bisecthosting.com/diamond\"></strong></a></p>",
